<div class="popup corner" id="popup-sharing-more-info">
    <button class="close"><img src="../assets/cross.svg" alt="close" title="close message"></button>
    <p class="message justify">
        you can share this link with max 5 people, who have 48h to accept the invite. 
        after 48h, no new viewers can join but those who already accepted the invite can view the album indefinitely. 
        you can visit 'sharing status' anytime to view access logs.
        if you notice something suspicious, hit 'revoke link' below to immediately terminate all access. 
        you can always create a new share link later if needed.</p>
</div>